OL,5,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,6,     FLive at the BBC Proms: BBC
OL,7,     FSymphony Orchestra and Chorus,
OL,8,     Fconductor Nil Venditti and star
OL,9,     Fsoloists perform Rossini's Stabat
OL,10,     FMater. Respighi's Church Windows
OL,11,     Flight the first half.
OL,12,G2200 Late Junction
OL,13,     FVerity Sharp presents a voyage
OL,14,     Faround the world of ear-bending
OL,15,     Fexperiments in sound.
OL,16,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,17,     FAlice Zawadzki is back with more
OL,18,     Fof the best jazz from the UK and
OL,19,     Faround the world, and she welcomes
OL,20,     FSwedish singer Frida Touray as her
OL,21,     FFriday night mixtape guest.
